    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Coralia alvus.</em> A walking coral reef and guardian of the ocean's shallows — an entire ecosystem given a body, healing its allies, firing paralytic spines, and summoning swarms of tiny krakens, sharks, and whales from within itself. Its lair is the Shelf in Regrowth. Habitat: Coastal &amp; Underwater.</p><p><strong>Gear:</strong> Staff.</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes X-29 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
