        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Ability:</strong> Wisdom; <strong>DC:</strong> 16; <strong>Modifier:</strong> +8. The reef avatar uses its Staff as a Spellcasting Focus and requires no Verbal components to cast the following spells.</p><p><strong>At Will:</strong> <em>Calm Waters</em>* (C), <em>Druidcraft</em>, <em>Enlarge/Reduce</em> (no Concentration required), <em>Riptide</em>* (C)</p><p><strong>4/Day:</strong> <em>Beacon of Hope</em> (C), <em>Purify Food and Drink</em>, <em>Sanctuary</em> (Bonus Action), <em>The Bends</em>*, <em>Water Breathing</em></p><p><strong>3/Day:</strong> <em>Control Water</em> (C), <em>Mass Cure Wounds</em>, <em>Plant Growth</em></p><p>*See the spells page of the Field Notes PDF; (C) indicates Concentration.</p>",
