          "value": "<p>The reef avatar summons a Swarm of Defenders in an unoccupied space within 10 feet of it. The swarm is made up of Tiny krakens, sharks, and whales, uses the Swarm of Piranhas stat block (or Swarm of Quippers in the 2014 rules), and takes its turn immediately after the reef avatar. The swarm lasts for 1 minute, after which it magically returns to the safety of the reef avatar's body.</p>",
